Z||000000||Dragon||08-15-2001||10:34 PM||||Hello<P>I just remembered that on the way back south from Williamsburg.  In Waverley, VA, on route 40, west of the tracks, on the north side of the road was:<P>What looked like a '85GT or '86 SE  Red that had been mowed around but has tall grass starting to grow under it.  It was to far away from Florida for me to stop and take a look.  Maybe somebody locally up there might find it interesting.<P>RFTH VI link <A HREF="http://spacecoastfieros.com/rfth6/" TARGET=_blank>http://spacecoastfieros.com/rfth6/</A> <P>------------------<BR>Dragon<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://spacecoastfieros.com/dragon.jpg">   <P>   Space Coast Fieros||||reg||3
